# Tool Box tab — temporarily hidden

The **Tool Box** nav item and homepage hero button are hidden (June 2025).

## Restore when ready

In `src/portfolios/nathaniel.js`, set:

```js
profile: {
  // ...
  showToolbox: true,
},
```

That re-enables the header tab and homepage link. The `/toolbox` route and page are still live at `/toolbox` for preview.

## Files touched when hiding

- `src/portfolios/nathaniel.js` — `profile.showToolbox`
- `src/components/Header.jsx` — filters toolbox from nav
- `src/pages/HomePage.jsx` — conditional hero button

When the user asks to work on the resume site or toolbox, mention this if `showToolbox` is still `false`.
